              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin Obaŋa nyuto baŋ odwarpiny luŋ doŋ odoko calo buk ame omwono doge oko i tu baŋwu. Ame ka omio baŋ dano moro ame ŋeo kwan kun kobbe ni, “Biye ikwan man”, en gamo ni, “Pe gira atwero kwano pien omwono doge oko,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok daŋ ka omio bukkono baŋ ŋat a kwia kwan, kun kobbe ni, “Biye ikwan man,” en gamo ni, “Pe gira atwero kwano.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.12",
